[gd_scene load_steps=5 format=3]

; A directly editable blue-green border rosette: bromeliad-like rather than a
; literal species model. Flattened lance meshes keep every leaf selectable
; while avoiding the old rectangular-block silhouette. Leaf meshes are four-sided
; since 2026-09-18: flattened to 0.26 they read as a ridged lance, and the eight
; rosettes a palm footing carries drop from 668 triangles each to about 290.

